# the joysticks of menu_dumps.py's walk heldask ("T N,X,Y,B", the format
# of m48_joy.joy): both there from the program's start, 570 their middle
0 0,570,570,0
0 1,570,570,0
# the first stick down four times: MISC
10.00 0,570,1100,0
10.20 0,570,570,0
11.00 0,570,1100,0
11.20 0,570,570,0
12.00 0,570,1100,0
12.20 0,570,570,0
13.00 0,570,1100,0
13.20 0,570,570,0
# its first button chooses it
14.00 0,570,570,1
14.20 0,570,570,0
# down: LOAD
16.00 0,570,1100,0
16.20 0,570,570,0
# the button chooses LOAD and stays held for three seconds (Esc by the
# keys at 19, while it is held)
17.00 0,570,570,1
20.00 0,570,570,0
# the button again, at the question
22.00 0,570,570,1
